<title>USA: Jax sees starting to pay dividend.</title>
<headline>Jax sees starting to pay dividend.</headline>
<dateline>EL PASO, Texas 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jax International Inc said Tuesday it will begin paying a 5 percent annual dividend at the end of this year's second quarter.</p>
<p>The dividend would either be in the form of stock or cash. The company's second quarter ends June 30.</p>
<p>Jax is a affordable-housing developer.</p>
